OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1789015694
OL,3,COlympian and World Champion win
OL,4,Cinternational triathlon event in Jersey
OL,6,FAn Australian World Champion and
OL,7,FFrench Olympian have won an
OL,8,Finternational triathlon competition in
OL,9,FJersey.
OL,11,FMore than a thousand spectators
OL,12,Fwatched the world's best triathletes
OL,13,Fat the Waterfront as they raced in the
OL,14,FSuperTri event, competing for the
OL,15,Fchance to win a share of the $800,000
OL,16,Fprize purse.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
