OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1789015694
OL,3,COlympian and World Champion win
OL,4,Cinternational triathlon event in Jersey
OL,6,FSuperTri is a global series of
OL,7,Ftriathlon festivals across Europe and
OL,8,FNorth America, which this year
OL,9,Fculminated in the Pro Series Final in
OL,10,FJersey.
OL,12,FAmongst the world-star athletes was
OL,13,Fthe island's very own Siena Stephens,
OL,14,Fwho was also called up last minute to
OL,15,Fcompete in 2025's event.
OL,17,FNow with more notice to prepare, the
OL,18,Fhomegrown talent showed she could go
OL,19,Fhead-to-head with the top triathletes
OL,20,F- especially in the water.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1789015694
OL,3,COlympian and World Champion win
OL,4,Cinternational triathlon event in Jersey
OL,6,F"It was a really hard race," Stephens
OL,7,Ftold ITV News. "You almost forget the
OL,8,Fabsolute whirlwind of it.
OL,10,F"For me, that first swim was really
OL,11,Fgood to come out fifth and win in that
OL,12,Ffield is so cool, and then the rest of
OL,13,Fit was almost just hanging on.
OL,15,F"The speed of those girls at the
OL,16,Ffront! To even be a minute and a half
OL,17,Faway from the Olympic champs in a race
OL,18,Flike that is still amazing."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
