CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1789015694
OL,3,COlympian and World Champion win
OL,4,Cinternational triathlon event in Jersey
OL,6,FThe day started with high hopes from
OL,7,FCosongor Lehmann and Jeanne Lehair,
OL,8,Fwho hoped to retain their titles in
OL,9,Fthe men's and women's race,
OL,10,Frespectively.
OL,12,FAs the men plunged in for their turn,
OL,13,Fone notable name was missing - Jonny
OL,14,FBrownlee is still the talk of the town
OL,15,Fafter a surprise announcement that he
OL,16,Fwas retiring on Friday 4 September.
OL,18,FBritish hopes largely rested on Alex
OL,19,FYee, but a broken bike chain ended his
OL,20,Fchances on what became a cursed corner
OL,21,Fof the course.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1789015694
OL,3,COlympian and World Champion win
OL,4,Cinternational triathlon event in Jersey
OL,6,FIn the end, it was a tight finish with
OL,7,Fthe top five triathletes within a
OL,8,Fsecond of each other.
OL,10,FAustralia's Matthew Hauser cut through
OL,11,Fthe chaos with a winning 52:06 finish,
OL,12,Fleaving previous winner Lehmann in
OL,13,Ffourth.
OL,15,FWhile a top prize of $100,000
OL,16,Fcertainly put a smile on Hauser's
OL,17,Fface, he told ITV News that it's the
OL,18,Fcommunity that makes Jersey a
OL,19,Fmemorable SuperTri event.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1789015694
OL,3,COlympian and World Champion win
OL,4,Cinternational triathlon event in Jersey
OL,6,F"For me, it's a special place, and I
OL,7,Flove coming back here," he explained.
OL,9,F"It's nice that the rain kind of
OL,10,Fstayed away a little bit this weekend,
OL,11,Fand I think it's just the community as
OL,12,Fwell."
OL,14,F"It's a small island, but has a big
OL,15,Fheart and a thriving community in the
OL,16,Fsporting world, so it's a credit to
OL,17,Fthe locals coming out and supporting
OL,18,Fus and giving so much of their time."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1789015694
OL,3,COlympian and World Champion win
OL,4,Cinternational triathlon event in Jersey
OL,6,FIn the women's race, ten of the
OL,7,Fseventeen competitors were eliminated
OL,8,Fbefore they could complete the course.
OL,10,FAs part of SuperTri rules, any athlete
OL,11,Fwho falls 90 seconds or more behind
OL,12,Fthe leader's pace at the end of an
OL,13,Findividual lap is eliminated.
OL,15,FWhile British triathletes Georgia
OL,16,FTaylor-Brown and Jessica Fullagar put
OL,17,Fin valiant efforts, the winning
OL,18,Femotions went to reigning Olympic
OL,19,Fchampion Cassandre Beaugrand.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1789015694
OL,3,COlympian and World Champion win
OL,4,Cinternational triathlon event in Jersey
OL,6,FDespite not nabbing a first-place
OL,7,Fspot, Taylor-Brown was thankful for
OL,8,Fthe crowd and atmosphere making it a
OL,9,Fspecial day.
OL,11,F"It was really special, and I'm always
OL,12,Fso grateful for the support that we
OL,13,Fget in Jersey", she told ITV News.
OL,15,F"So many people come out on their
OL,16,FSunday afternoon just to watch us when
OL,17,Fthey could just be chilling at home.
OL,19,F"It really does mean a lot and makes
OL,20,Fme quite emotional."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
